as well as how to address some of these challenges,

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.600
specifically vanishing gradients,

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.720
by building even more powerful models of an RNN.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:29.760
So in the next video,

